[[File:SoroSuub3000LuxuryYacht-SWE.jpg|thumb|250px|A yacht of [[SoroSuub Corporation|SoroSuub]] design]]
A '''Yacht''',<ref name="Databank Luxury 300">{{Databank|luxury-3000-space-yacht|Luxury 3000 Space Yacht}}</ref> or '''Star Yacht''',<ref name="TLJ ICS">''[[Star Wars: The Last Jedi: Incredible Cross-Sections]]''</ref> was a generalized term for any type of [[Starship|vessel]] whose primary purpose was that of recreation and leisure, as well for the personal vessels of certain individuals. The [[Personal Luxury Yacht 3000|Luxury 3000 space yacht]]<ref name="Databank Luxury 300" /> and the [[Petite Opu-Yacht]] were examples of this type of vessel,<ref name="Join the Resistance">''[[Join the Resistance]]''</ref> as was the ''[[Mellcrawler]]''<ref name="Moving Target">''[[Moving Target: A Princess Leia Adventure]]''</ref> and the ''[[Stinger Mantis]]''.<ref name="Databank">{{Databank|stinger-mantis|''Stinger Mantis''}}</ref>

